OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy and
OL,6,Fdamp during the evening, but tending
OL,7,Fto become drier and clearer during the
OL,8,Fearly hours. Staying mild, with the
OL,9,Fwarmth tempered a little by the brisk
OL,10,Fwind.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FOn the cloudy side as a weak
OL,13,Fband of mainly light rain edges
OL,14,Fsouthwards, becoming slow-moving but
OL,15,Fdeveloping breaks later. Warm,
OL,16,Fespecially in developing sunny spells.
OL,17,FWinds gradually easing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
